# Build outputs and caches never belong in a build context: they bloat the upload, they
# invalidate layer caching on every local build, and a stale bin/ can silently shadow a
# freshly compiled one.
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.angular/
**/TestResults/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/

.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/

**/*.user
**/*.suo
Dockerfile*
docker-compose*.yml
README.md
